  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Crazed Demon Cave’s ninth layer, Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable sees blocks of floating ice of various sizes and strange shapes and names them the truthful floating ice, realizing Limitless kept what he never found when exploring the River of Time.",
      "chapters": [
        2171
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In The Legends of Ren Zu, Ren Zu’s group recognizes ice floating on the River of Time as truthful floating ice from Qian Kun Crystal Wall knowledge.",
      "chapters": [
        2184
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
        "char_ren_zu",
        "loc_qian_kun_crystal_wall"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later sees orbiting pieces that from afar look like a giant ball, with sizes continuing to grow as a rank nine formation’s deduction gains fueled by eighth-layer dead Gu Immortals and immortal apertures.",
      "chapters": [
        2187
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pieces differ in size and shape in different viewers’ eyes, and emotional impact differs as well.",
      "chapters": [
        2189
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan unseals a piece in his aperture it is blue-white ice that shrinks inch by inch.",
      "chapters": [
        2237
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Unsealing raises heaven path dao marks rapidly and also lifts other paths’ attainment levels more slowly, with heaven path rising most.",
      "chapters": [
        2237
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unseal-and-derivation-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After the Crazed Demon Cave battle, Star Constellation Immortal Venerable takes a piece that contains derivation Gu and uses Heavenly Court’s heaven path research to unseal it and retrieve that Gu. Limitless Demon Venerable had used derivation Immortal Gu and chaos outside the world to create that truthful floating ice, which does not belong to this world in essence.",
      "chapters": [
        2274
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
